/**
 * Mini API gateway built on node:http only.
 *
 * Features:
 *  - prefix routing with path rewrite (config-driven, longest-prefix wins)
 *  - per-route token-bucket rate limits
 *  - retries idempotent GETs exactly once when upstream answers 502/503
 *  - hard upstream timeout -> 504
 *  - X-Forwarded-For append + X-Request-ID propagation (generated if absent)
